  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1101.03 Citation",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-05-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1101.03 “Citation” means any summons, ticket, or other document issued by a person authorized by RSA 21-P:4,VII and the provisions of these rules for a violation of fire safety rules adopted pursuant to RSA 153:4-a, RSA 153:5 and RSA 160-C, and to unlicensed persons who perform actions that require a license pursuant to RSA 153:28 or RSA 153:29-a, ordering the person named in the document to appear in the court specified.\n\nSource. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 1101.02), EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1100.html"
